# -*- mode: sh -*-

# x-sailjail-description = Open mail from notifications
# x-sailjail-long-description = Lets SF-Mail serve com.jolla.email.ui — the
#   D-Bus interface the system's mail notifications, mailto: links and "share
#   via email" call into. Without this the sandbox only permits the app's own
#   name, so a tap on a new-mail banner opens the stock client instead.

dbus-user.own com.jolla.email.ui
